stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unregistered
    Unregistered --> Activating: import Mac hardware info
    Activating --> Registered: IDS registration accepted
    Activating --> ActivationFailed: cert rejected or throttled
    Registered --> Active: APS connected
    Active --> RenewalDue: renewal window reached
    RenewalDue --> Renewing
    Renewing --> Active: renewed
    Renewing --> Throttled: Apple throttles
    Renewing --> Blocked: account blocked
    Throttled --> RenewalDue: backoff elapsed
    Active --> TransportUnavailable: protocol change breaks client
    TransportUnavailable --> Active: client updated
    ActivationFailed --> [*]: fall back to RelayTransport
    Blocked --> [*]: account unrecoverable

    note right of Active
        Normal operation.
        Send and receive both work.
    end note

    note right of TransportUnavailable
        RelayTransport remains usable,
        so history stays readable.
    end note
